(3840717, 543856, 34618, '<td valign="top">This is a very cool shot. The ethereal "glow" under the frog is very compelling (like WHAT is it?) and really balances the composition on that side against the reflection on the right. The sharp focus on the frog also strikes a great balance against the reflected object on the right, too. And the colors are so "together". And the wide crop is perfect, too. However... there''s a massive dust spot at about 1 o''clock off of the frog which really detracts. Other than that, this picture is definitely a "9".</td>', 'This is a very cool shot. The ethereal "glow" under the frog is very compelling (like WHAT is it?) and really balances the composition on that side against the reflection on the right. The sharp focus on the frog also strikes a great balance against the reflected object on the right, too. And the colors are so "together". And the wide crop is perfect, too. However... there''s a massive dust spot at about 1 o''clock off of the frog which really detracts. Other than that, this picture is definitely a "9".', '2007-06-27 08:48:01.000000', NULL, 1),
