(3843904, 542737, 67834, '<td valign="top">nice macro, i find the background a little overpowering even though it is blurred as the colour is quite bright, technically perhaps shifting to the left or right to change the angle slighly may have fixed this and given it a fresher perspective. You''ve done really well to get the subject sharp and the composition is neat, good work! 7</td>', 'nice macro, i find the background a little overpowering even though it is blurred as the colour is quite bright, technically perhaps shifting to the left or right to change the angle slighly may have fixed this and given it a fresher perspective. You''ve done really well to get the subject sharp and the composition is neat, good work! 7', '2007-06-28 00:00:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3843911, 543129, 68504, '<td valign="top">Great combination of simplicity and spectacle; good composition; excellent solo.</td>', 'Great combination of simplicity and spectacle; good composition; excellent solo.', '2007-06-28 00:04:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3843912, 543746, 67834, '<td valign="top">i like the effect you are trying to create, the light really brings out the texture in the wood and i really like this aspect of the shot. <br/>However, I do think this shot falls down technically, especially on how the light is captured. I would have much prefered to see a sharp flame rather than a blurred blob with the halo. I know your focus is on the foreground of the wood but I would also like to see the candle a little sharper as this is also a strong focal point of the image and of perhaps more interest than the wood itself. <br/>So personally I like what you are trying to do but as it falls down technically I can only give this a 6.</td>', 'i like the effect you are trying to create, the light really brings out the texture in the wood and i really like this aspect of the shot. However, I do think this shot falls down technically, especially on how the light is captured. I would have much prefered to see a sharp flame rather than a blurred blob with the halo. I know your focus is on the foreground of the wood but I would also like to see the candle a little sharper as this is also a strong focal point of the image and of perhaps more interest than the wood itself. So personally I like what you are trying to do but as it falls down technically I can only give this a 6.', '2007-06-28 00:04:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3843918, 541099, 67834, '<td valign="top">this is nice and I especially like the way the light hits the edges of the caterpillar. If there was any one thing I would have done differently it would be to change the perspective as being straight on doesn''t really feel right for me and causes the caterpillar to be a tad underexposed and washed out. 6</td>', 'this is nice and I especially like the way the light hits the edges of the caterpillar. If there was any one thing I would have done differently it would be to change the perspective as being straight on doesn''t really feel right for me and causes the caterpillar to be a tad underexposed and washed out. 6', '2007-06-28 00:07:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3843920, 541566, 75713, '<td valign="top">I love the colors and the muted b/g ... nicely done.</td>', 'I love the colors and the muted b/g ... nicely done.', '2007-06-28 00:07:42.000000', NULL, 1),
