(3844806, 544036, 75034, '<td valign="top">great shot made me chuckle</td>', 'great shot made me chuckle', '2007-06-28 09:47:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3844811, 543094, 42100, '<td valign="top">Very nice tones to this, the b&amp;w/sepia really seems to fit the mood of the scene.  You really made the most of an overcast day with this conversion.  Having couples in the scene with the solo man really gives this photo an extra depth.  Great photo, definitely my top pick of this challenge!</td>', 'Very nice tones to this, the b&w/sepia really seems to fit the mood of the scene.  You really made the most of an overcast day with this conversion.  Having couples in the scene with the solo man really gives this photo an extra depth.  Great photo, definitely my top pick of this challenge!', '2007-06-28 09:50:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3844813, 541071, 75034, '<td valign="top">great shot . fantastic DOF! great choice for B&amp;W colour would have taken to much away.</td>', 'great shot . fantastic DOF! great choice for B&W colour would have taken to much away.', '2007-06-28 09:51:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3844816, 541106, 42100, '<td valign="top">This guy really looks like a unique character.  There is something about his body language I can''t quite put my finger...I feel like it''s something I should be picking up on.  Very nice b&amp;w/sepia conversion, really fits overall with the mood of the photo.  Great job!</td>', 'This guy really looks like a unique character.  There is something about his body language I can''t quite put my finger...I feel like it''s something I should be picking up on.  Very nice b&w/sepia conversion, really fits overall with the mood of the photo.  Great job!', '2007-06-28 09:53:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3844827, 541235, 42100, '<td valign="top">I can just hear the roar of the waves crashing, the immense power of them.  Yet I can feel the great peace and calm that comes with being there at the ocean, especially when you''re alone on the beach.  Wish I was there now!  The light is really, really nice.  Very beautiful photo!</td>', 'I can just hear the roar of the waves crashing, the immense power of them.  Yet I can feel the great peace and calm that comes with being there at the ocean, especially when you''re alone on the beach.  Wish I was there now!  The light is really, really nice.  Very beautiful photo!', '2007-06-28 09:58:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3844835, 543579, 42100, '<td valign="top">The repeating pattern of spires alone takes this beyond being a just photo of towers.  I like how you set the large one is off by itself(the soloist), yet have the accompanying choir just off to the side are ready to do their back-up parts of the song and are balancing the photo''s composition.  Very beautiful dusk light and photograph!</td>', 'The repeating pattern of spires alone takes this beyond being a just photo of towers.  I like how you set the large one is off by itself(the soloist), yet have the accompanying choir just off to the side are ready to do their back-up parts of the song and are balancing the photo''s composition.  Very beautiful dusk light and photograph!', '2007-06-28 10:03:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3844843, 544231, 42100, '<td valign="top">Lots of great layers to this composition, I find myself peeling them back to get to the heart and soul of this scene.  Such a fascinating photograph...great job!</td>', 'Lots of great layers to this composition, I find myself peeling them back to get to the heart and soul of this scene.  Such a fascinating photograph...great job!', '2007-06-28 10:08:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3844909, 543681, 49105, '<td valign="top">Very nice picture, love the tilted, teared tree. Its pity for the fence (I know, photo editing is not allowed) but still a remarkable capture.</td>', 'Very nice picture, love the tilted, teared tree. Its pity for the fence (I know, photo editing is not allowed) but still a remarkable capture.', '2007-06-28 10:32:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3844911, 543365, 49105, '<td valign="top">Beautiful animal, gread DOF and colors.</td>', 'Beautiful animal, gread DOF and colors.', '2007-06-28 10:32:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3844913, 543395, 45857, '<td valign="top">love the tones</td>', 'love the tones', '2007-06-28 10:33:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3844915, 543972, 45857, '<td valign="top">nice study</td>', 'nice study', '2007-06-28 10:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
