(3845120, 543790, 35014, '<td valign="top">Good capture.  It would have been better using a noise lowering filter like neat image or noise ninja to give it a smoother feel.</td>', 'Good capture.  It would have been better using a noise lowering filter like neat image or noise ninja to give it a smoother feel.', '2007-06-28 12:15:39.000000', NULL, 1),
