(3845156, 540335, 76430, '<td valign="top">The flash is a bit harsh, it''s kind of grainy, and the right arm is OOF, but other than that, nice composition, timing and coloring, though the red on the right is a bit oversaturated.  It looks like she''s been working hard at something.</td>', 'The flash is a bit harsh, it''s kind of grainy, and the right arm is OOF, but other than that, nice composition, timing and coloring, though the red on the right is a bit oversaturated.  It looks like she''s been working hard at something.', '2007-06-28 12:32:33.000000', NULL, 1),
