(3846932, 543394, 66085, '<td valign="top">I tried microwaving a cd as well and I thought it was going to blow up, I was scared that I ruined the microwave and it''d start on fire.  Nice light refraction.</td>', 'I tried microwaving a cd as well and I thought it was going to blow up, I was scared that I ruined the microwave and it''d start on fire.  Nice light refraction.', '2007-06-28 23:52:04.000000', NULL, 1),
