(3848393, 543806, 42100, '<td valign="top">Interesting collection of colors and tones in this photo...the dark and ominous in the direction she''s heading.  Symbolism for venturing into the unknown?  The safe and calming of the green grasses where she is at, leaving the known behind.  Then the very bright colors of her top and suitcase, I''m guessing they represent her excitement and enthusiasm of her journey.  I like the artistic tilt...great photo!</td>', 'Interesting collection of colors and tones in this photo...the dark and ominous in the direction she''s heading.  Symbolism for venturing into the unknown?  The safe and calming of the green grasses where she is at, leaving the known behind.  Then the very bright colors of her top and suitcase, I''m guessing they represent her excitement and enthusiasm of her journey.  I like the artistic tilt...great photo!', '2007-06-29 11:09:18.000000', NULL, 1),
