(3851197, 542391, 66494, '<td valign="top">I really like the shot, the lines, the angles, and the shadows are really nice. The only thing I found distracting was the two people in the bottom right corner--I think it would have been more powerful if they were cropped out. That shadow is so strong and sure helps this image be powerful.</td>', 'I really like the shot, the lines, the angles, and the shadows are really nice. The only thing I found distracting was the two people in the bottom right corner--I think it would have been more powerful if they were cropped out. That shadow is so strong and sure helps this image be powerful.', '2007-06-30 13:26:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3851201, 544105, 66494, '<td valign="top">Wow, does that color pop beautifully.</td>', 'Wow, does that color pop beautifully.', '2007-06-30 13:28:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3851216, 542623, 66494, '<td valign="top">Clever use of the styrafoam cup name.</td>', 'Clever use of the styrafoam cup name.', '2007-06-30 13:37:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3851363, 541989, 76430, '<td valign="top">This one has my highest rating so far, partially because I love mountain scenes and I''m a bike rider myself.  Nice shot.  It would have been good if you could have gotten rid of the yellow lines at roadside.</td>', 'This one has my highest rating so far, partially because I love mountain scenes and I''m a bike rider myself.  Nice shot.  It would have been good if you could have gotten rid of the yellow lines at roadside.', '2007-06-30 15:16:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3851457, 544092, 76430, '<td valign="top">Good solo shot with background bokeh.</td>', 'Good solo shot with background bokeh.', '2007-06-30 16:00:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3851459, 543993, 76430, '<td valign="top">Good lighting using the moon to silouette the statue and trees.</td>', 'Good lighting using the moon to silouette the statue and trees.', '2007-06-30 16:00:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3851468, 543872, 76430, '<td valign="top">and I''m sure his terms will win.  Great shot with excellent feather detail.</td>', 'and I''m sure his terms will win.  Great shot with excellent feather detail.', '2007-06-30 16:09:30.000000', NULL, 1),
