(3863261, 543395, 60698, '<td valign="top">I am not voting on this one, but wanted to comment. A wonderful photo that tells a story. The lighting is perfect and pose is wonderful and natural. I like the focus and the textures of the tree, skin, hat etc... The out of focus areas really bring him forward and make you feel like you are there. An lastly, who couldn''t love the sepia conversion you''ve done here! Fantastic!</td>', 'I am not voting on this one, but wanted to comment. A wonderful photo that tells a story. The lighting is perfect and pose is wonderful and natural. I like the focus and the textures of the tree, skin, hat etc... The out of focus areas really bring him forward and make you feel like you are there. An lastly, who couldn''t love the sepia conversion you''ve done here! Fantastic!', '2007-07-03 14:32:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3863320, 543430, 42100, '<td valign="top">Lots of great negative space that isn''t so negative(lots of interest) in this photo.  It definitely gives a strong emphasis to scale.  Very fun and whimsical photo!</td>', 'Lots of great negative space that isn''t so negative(lots of interest) in this photo.  It definitely gives a strong emphasis to scale.  Very fun and whimsical photo!', '2007-07-03 14:45:35.000000', NULL, 1),
