(3866027, 543432, 48471, '<td valign="top">How''s this related to solo? Well, there''s a single taxi moving, so that guy went solo, while the other two guys are still waiting, strengthening the feeling of the solo action of the other taxi. Now, not only that he went solo, but he went rebellious, because the sign says Tomare, which means Stop! As the homeless cat ( <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=66597" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">noraneko</a> )observes, it''s written upside down, so maybe the Taxi understood it in an upside down way, meaning to the opposite of what the message says. But, people don''t know about the Taxi''s ways of thinking, so that''s why they look so baffled. And, it''s five (baffled?) people, don''t forget the ojii-sans. I can''t say all of them are, the top most left ojii-san seems like he doesn''t care what''s going on.<br/> <br/>Thanks for the visits, the votes and the comments.</td>', 'How''s this related to solo? Well, there''s a single taxi moving, so that guy went solo, while the other two guys are still waiting, strengthening the feeling of the solo action of the other taxi. Now, not only that he went solo, but he went rebellious, because the sign says Tomare, which means Stop! As the homeless cat (  noraneko )observes, it''s written upside down, so maybe the Taxi understood it in an upside down way, meaning to the opposite of what the message says. But, people don''t know about the Taxi''s ways of thinking, so that''s why they look so baffled. And, it''s five (baffled?) people, don''t forget the ojii-sans. I can''t say all of them are, the top most left ojii-san seems like he doesn''t care what''s going on. Thanks for the visits, the votes and the comments.', '2007-07-04 05:31:12.000000', NULL, 0),
