(3866372, 541939, 74979, '<td valign="top">a classic NYC shot!  I used to love to hang by the water during lunch when I worked on Wall St.  It was always a great place to go &amp; clear the head, despite being in a suit! Statetn Island Ferry another great spot..<br/>Iliked this a lot during the challenge, gave it a 7, I didn''t notice anyone else in the frame (still don''t actually) I loved the clever idea re: POV, and the contrast btw the heavy metal beams and the image itself.  I guess on a personal note, it must have also caused a few twangs.<br/>~Anni</td>', 'a classic NYC shot!  I used to love to hang by the water during lunch when I worked on Wall St.  It was always a great place to go & clear the head, despite being in a suit! Statetn Island Ferry another great spot..Iliked this a lot during the challenge, gave it a 7, I didn''t notice anyone else in the frame (still don''t actually) I loved the clever idea re: POV, and the contrast btw the heavy metal beams and the image itself.  I guess on a personal note, it must have also caused a few twangs.~Anni', '2007-07-04 08:19:13.000000', NULL, 0),
