(3867095, 543303, 24454, '<td valign="top">Awwww. . .poor baby.   Who wouldn''t want to play with that adorable little thing.   But what another great slice of life you have captured.  Makes me want to find him and take him to the park or zoo or something.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Awwww. . .poor baby.   Who wouldn''t want to play with that adorable little thing.   But what another great slice of life you have captured.  Makes me want to find him and take him to the park or zoo or something. ', '2007-07-04 11:42:06.000000', NULL, 0),
