(3867214, 543303, 47933, '<td valign="top">Wow Sevil. 1 comment during the challenge? I didn''t vote in this one but you know this is right up my alley. The subject, tone and open space in front are simply magnificent. Great work!</td>', 'Wow Sevil. 1 comment during the challenge? I didn''t vote in this one but you know this is right up my alley. The subject, tone and open space in front are simply magnificent. Great work!', '2007-07-04 12:00:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(3867269, 543691, 68586, '<td valign="top">Sandy, lovely shot, and great cropping.<br/> <br/>Your White bird did better than mine   :  )</td>', 'Sandy, lovely shot, and great cropping. Your White bird did better than mine   :  )', '2007-07-04 12:12:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(3867280, 543698, 68586, '<td valign="top">Should have made the top ten. Nice tight crop. lovely light and colours.<br/> <br/>And if it can be said of a hermit crab . . nice pose.</td>', 'Should have made the top ten. Nice tight crop. lovely light and colours. And if it can be said of a hermit crab . . nice pose.', '2007-07-04 12:14:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(3867303, 543586, 78303, '<td valign="top">I was going for a dark look intentionaly, for emotion.  The light was low to begin with and I thought the single spot on the guitarist brought out the feeling in the moment.  (Or I was just having a lot of fun, standing in the front row!)<br/> <br/>I had been doing a lot with ISO1600 and 3200 before this shot, but went down to 800 to lower the noise a touch.</td>', 'I was going for a dark look intentionaly, for emotion.  The light was low to begin with and I thought the single spot on the guitarist brought out the feeling in the moment.  (Or I was just having a lot of fun, standing in the front row!) I had been doing a lot with ISO1600 and 3200 before this shot, but went down to 800 to lower the noise a touch.', '2007-07-04 12:25:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(3867401, 543430, 34659, '<td valign="top">WTG Phillip!  Congrats on a terrific shot and another ribbon.  Beautiful work.  GO Untouchables!!</td>', 'WTG Phillip!  Congrats on a terrific shot and another ribbon.  Beautiful work.  GO Untouchables!!', '2007-07-04 12:48:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(3867405, 543747, 34659, '<td valign="top">Stunning...  Absolutely beautiful.</td>', 'Stunning...  Absolutely beautiful.', '2007-07-04 12:49:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(3867414, 543806, 34659, '<td valign="top">You''re right Manny, I never would have guessed this was yours.  HOWEVER, the same level of quality, expertise, and talent shines through.  Well done!</td>', 'You''re right Manny, I never would have guessed this was yours.  HOWEVER, the same level of quality, expertise, and talent shines through.  Well done!', '2007-07-04 12:51:30.000000', NULL, 0),
