(3867913, 541106, 49865, '<td valign="top">This image implicitly tells a very sad story. What especially catches my eye in this photo and what drives home the solitude is the way the man is sitting on the very edge of the bench.</td>', 'This image implicitly tells a very sad story. What especially catches my eye in this photo and what drives home the solitude is the way the man is sitting on the very edge of the bench.', '2007-07-04 14:48:28.000000', NULL, 0),
