(3868183, 544053, 67697, '<td valign="top">I am surprised this did not score higher.  The composition, DOF, and focus is amazing.  This is such an emotional pic and I just feel sad for the little one.  I think it''s a great photo.</td>', 'I am surprised this did not score higher.  The composition, DOF, and focus is amazing.  This is such an emotional pic and I just feel sad for the little one.  I think it''s a great photo.', '2007-07-04 16:14:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(3868194, 542234, 67697, '<td valign="top">Oh come on now, what''s wrong with a woman beating a drum?  This is really interesting - I have never seen anything like this.  It''s too bad more people did not leave comments about what they were looking for.  Good composition balance, I like the framing, and the boat is headed out of the pic.  Should not have scored below 5 for sure!</td>', 'Oh come on now, what''s wrong with a woman beating a drum?  This is really interesting - I have never seen anything like this.  It''s too bad more people did not leave comments about what they were looking for.  Good composition balance, I like the framing, and the boat is headed out of the pic.  Should not have scored below 5 for sure!', '2007-07-04 16:19:50.000000', NULL, 0),
