(3873002, 542100, 77192, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by SoulMan1978:</b></div><hr/><i> I''m docking you 3 points because of the typo in the title...<br/> <br/>Only joking. Great shot!!!! 10 from me :-) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Oh I didn;t realise it was delibarate... That''ll teach me to be badly educated ;-)<br/> <br/>Just out of interest, how did you post process it?<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-07-05 18:53:05.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by SoulMan1978: I''m docking you 3 points because of the typo in the title... Only joking. Great shot!!!! 10 from me :-)   Oh I didn;t realise it was delibarate... That''ll teach me to be badly educated ;-) Just out of interest, how did you post process it?', '2007-07-05 19:51:43.000000', '2007-07-05 19:53:05.000000', 0),
