(3874187, 543430, 23458, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the ribbon - perfectly composed, joyful image.</td>', 'Congrats on the ribbon - perfectly composed, joyful image.', '2007-07-06 00:07:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(3874331, 543042, 74371, '<td valign="top">Wow... You definitely have an eye for the right picture! I looked at your profile and I couldn''t believe my eyes... you are so young (not a bad thing)! My baby-brother''s grandson is older than you! And look what you created!!!!!!!!<br/> <br/>This was a very nice shot...well balanced, tightly focussed and most of all... an incredibly wonderfully lit shot! This looks like you had the gentleman in your studio with lights here and lights over there and reflector down there. But it isn''t! It is CANDID!!!!!!! <br/> <br/>Great job! Look to see a lot more from you in the future! <br/> <br/>And...tell your Mom and Dad congratulations from me also. Although all that you learned and exhibited in this photo(and the other shots on your profile) are a reflection of your talent and your talent alone... they obviously were the ones who steered you towards photography, helped guide you towards loving it... and gave you a great eye! Outstanding!!</td>', 'Wow... You definitely have an eye for the right picture! I looked at your profile and I couldn''t believe my eyes... you are so young (not a bad thing)! My baby-brother''s grandson is older than you! And look what you created!!!!!!!! This was a very nice shot...well balanced, tightly focussed and most of all... an incredibly wonderfully lit shot! This looks like you had the gentleman in your studio with lights here and lights over there and reflector down there. But it isn''t! It is CANDID!!!!!!!  Great job! Look to see a lot more from you in the future!  And...tell your Mom and Dad congratulations from me also. Although all that you learned and exhibited in this photo(and the other shots on your profile) are a reflection of your talent and your talent alone... they obviously were the ones who steered you towards photography, helped guide you towards loving it... and gave you a great eye! Outstanding!!', '2007-07-06 01:12:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(3874477, 544231, 31403, '<td valign="top">terrific work - love everything about this.  The story is obvious to me even before I read your comments.<br/> <br/>I''m interested in the technicals here.  The DOF seems really deep for a f/2.8 shot.  Is this cropped heavily?  My guess is you standing back from the window and had to crop down to this so the DOF works - would love to hear your side of it so I don''t have to guess anymore!<br/> <br/>Amazing work like this being consistently overlooked is a distressing trend on this site.  I choose to fight the trend by removing myself from it''s influence.  I''m glad you''re still submitting such great work.</td>', 'terrific work - love everything about this.  The story is obvious to me even before I read your comments. I''m interested in the technicals here.  The DOF seems really deep for a f/2.8 shot.  Is this cropped heavily?  My guess is you standing back from the window and had to crop down to this so the DOF works - would love to hear your side of it so I don''t have to guess anymore! Amazing work like this being consistently overlooked is a distressing trend on this site.  I choose to fight the trend by removing myself from it''s influence.  I''m glad you''re still submitting such great work.', '2007-07-06 02:11:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(3874481, 544231, 15711, '<td valign="top">So underrated.  This is spectacular.  Goes to show if it doesn''t bite ''em in the ass, they don''t get it.  Way artistic and cool, skip.</td>', 'So underrated.  This is spectacular.  Goes to show if it doesn''t bite ''em in the ass, they don''t get it.  Way artistic and cool, skip.', '2007-07-06 02:14:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(3874604, 544153, 65713, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, good composition. Maybe from a slightly lower angle would have been better and helped you to lose distracting objects.</td>', 'Nice shot, good composition. Maybe from a slightly lower angle would have been better and helped you to lose distracting objects.', '2007-07-06 03:31:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(3874613, 542100, 9668, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by boyd2000:</b></div><hr/><i>Can you explain how you managed to create the golden color while keeping the surf nearly white in Basic Editing? </i></td></tr></table><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by SoulMan1978:</b></div><hr/><i>Just out of interest, how did you post process it? </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Editing steps in Photoshop CS included Shadow/Highlight, Levels, Color Balance, maybe a little bit of of Hue/Saturation, Image Size and USM. The color shift was achieved using color balance: bumping the reds and yellows way up in different amounts in shadows, midtones and highlights.</td>', 'Originally posted by boyd2000:Can you explain how you managed to create the golden color while keeping the surf nearly white in Basic Editing? Originally posted by SoulMan1978:Just out of interest, how did you post process it?  Editing steps in Photoshop CS included Shadow/Highlight, Levels, Color Balance, maybe a little bit of of Hue/Saturation, Image Size and USM. The color shift was achieved using color balance: bumping the reds and yellows way up in different amounts in shadows, midtones and highlights.', '2007-07-06 03:39:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(3874669, 543797, 21124, '<td valign="top">I think that the editing is fine: it looks unusual, but it''s overall nicely done.<br/>To me, the problem lies into composition. Your subject is too much centered, especially horizontally. Using the usual rule of thirds, you would have placed it a bit more toward the left-bottom, and it would probably have improved this photo.</td>', 'I think that the editing is fine: it looks unusual, but it''s overall nicely done.To me, the problem lies into composition. Your subject is too much centered, especially horizontally. Using the usual rule of thirds, you would have placed it a bit more toward the left-bottom, and it would probably have improved this photo.', '2007-07-06 04:20:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(3874756, 543430, 55838, '<td valign="top">Congratulations Phil - very well deserved ribbon!  Wonderful sky and ya gotta love little teeny tiny leaping people!  : )  Great job!!</td>', 'Congratulations Phil - very well deserved ribbon!  Wonderful sky and ya gotta love little teeny tiny leaping people!  : )  Great job!!', '2007-07-06 06:39:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(3874768, 541106, 48560, '<td valign="top">i feel sorry for the man in the shot.<br/>i know a very old man who was alone after his wife passed away, and they had no children. it is saddening, and this photo brings out that very same emotion (assuming similar fate). good photo.<br/> <br/>crayon</td>', 'i feel sorry for the man in the shot.i know a very old man who was alone after his wife passed away, and they had no children. it is saddening, and this photo brings out that very same emotion (assuming similar fate). good photo. crayon', '2007-07-06 07:01:25.000000', NULL, 0),
