(3883094, 541106, 80433, '<td valign="top">I think the main reason this photo intrigues us is because of the fact that many ideas and stories can be drawn from it. This capture suits the saying "A photo is worth a thousand words" perfectly.<br/> <br/>Very beautiful, also nice job on choosing to make this a sepia. If it were black and white it would have been too depressing, if it were color, the background would have been too detracting! <br/> <br/>Congrats =D</td>', 'I think the main reason this photo intrigues us is because of the fact that many ideas and stories can be drawn from it. This capture suits the saying "A photo is worth a thousand words" perfectly. Very beautiful, also nice job on choosing to make this a sepia. If it were black and white it would have been too depressing, if it were color, the background would have been too detracting!  Congrats =D', '2007-07-08 20:41:53.000000', NULL, 0),
