(3886019, 542719, 62318, '<td valign="top">Well, I made some comments in our private thread, but I still think this is a gorgeous shot. It doesn''t have all the fluff needed for a high score, but as far as a real moment in time this one is terrific. I love it.</td>', 'Well, I made some comments in our private thread, but I still think this is a gorgeous shot. It doesn''t have all the fluff needed for a high score, but as far as a real moment in time this one is terrific. I love it.', '2007-07-09 14:24:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(3886257, 543747, 38127, '<td valign="top">Having seen/been a part of the chaos all around this particular shoot.. I''d say creating this mood and capturing it so beautifully was nothing short of spectacular. <br/> <br/>Agreed about you having mojo to spare... when the idea strikes its brilliant everytime.  Nice work P!! Congrats on your top ten!!</td>', 'Having seen/been a part of the chaos all around this particular shoot.. I''d say creating this mood and capturing it so beautifully was nothing short of spectacular.  Agreed about you having mojo to spare... when the idea strikes its brilliant everytime.  Nice work P!! Congrats on your top ten!!', '2007-07-09 15:59:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(3886945, 542423, 59029, '<td valign="top">I think it''s a great action shot esp with flying spurts of dust behind it.  From a more tech viewpoint maybe people didn''t like it running towards the left - here, we''re so used to going left to right. In some countries horses do run widdershins - counter-clockwise, in non-archaic English, but to the best of my knowledge not in N. America. Did you flip the pic?<br/> <br/> I''d personally wouldn''t mind seeing more detail on the horse, but that''s just me. :-)</td>', 'I think it''s a great action shot esp with flying spurts of dust behind it.  From a more tech viewpoint maybe people didn''t like it running towards the left - here, we''re so used to going left to right. In some countries horses do run widdershins - counter-clockwise, in non-archaic English, but to the best of my knowledge not in N. America. Did you flip the pic?  I''d personally wouldn''t mind seeing more detail on the horse, but that''s just me. :-)', '2007-07-09 19:49:57.000000', NULL, 0),
