(3931187, 541810, 22301, '<td valign="top">Huh, this is as good as any other motorcycle shot I have seen finish in the mid to high 6''s. can''t see what is missing, maybe it was the title that made everyone back off a point for being to wordy? It''s still currently the highest rated shot for your new camera :)</td>', 'Huh, this is as good as any other motorcycle shot I have seen finish in the mid to high 6''s. can''t see what is missing, maybe it was the title that made everyone back off a point for being to wordy? It''s still currently the highest rated shot for your new camera :)', '2007-07-24 04:52:34.000000', NULL, 0),
